1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,220
I don't get frustrated at my own failings.

2
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:14,080
That kind of thing never has been,
and never will be, a part of my life.

3
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:28,340
I simply confront the evils
that force this reality upon us.

4
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,210
And I will.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,540
Arrogant bastards.

6
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,937
You are my special.

7
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,077
You

8
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:56,257
